ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "oak between the last cap slot and the window rebate", 28.3, "mm on the top face"
ECHO: "DRC", "NOTE", "LED tops to the frosted window's top face", 5, "mm - frosted acrylic this far above the LEDs softens the pixels; the owner chose it (2026-09-26)"
ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "etherCON body inside the cavity height", [6.3, 32.3, 6, 33], "body Z range vs cavity Z range at the tail, where the key plate has ended"
ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "key plate reaches past the last fastener pair", 19.25, "mm of plate beyond the tap hole; the plate stops short of the Matrix"
ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "LED tops under the frosted window", 2, "mm, LED tops to the acrylic's underside - the board's top face is against the oak"
ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "LED array fits the window opening it stands in", 1.2, "mm across, opening less the array"
