ECHO: "DRC", "FAIL", "tail cap web between the USB-C cutout and the etherCON flange", 1.5, "mm of oak on the tail face"
ECHO: "DRC", "INFO", "USB-C extension cable run, Matrix edge to receptacle", 19.5487, "mm straight line; buy the shortest extension that reaches, with slack for the tail cap to come off"
